WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.535
Hera, going to check.

00:02.235 --> 00:10.074
This is Hera, a European spacecraft sent to the same pair of asteroids, due there in November 2026.

00:10.524 --> 00:21.754
It will survey the little moon after the crash and measure its mass, to turn that one experiment into a method that can be repeated if a dangerous rock is ever found.
